Build from Git
==============

See README.md for the full Debian/Ubuntu dependency list and queue setup.

    autoreconf -fi
    ./configure --enable-persistent-usb
    make
    make ppd
    make check
    sudo make install

The raster filter installs directly into CUPS's filter directory. With the
persistent option enabled, the daemon, root-run backend and systemd unit
are installed too. Service enablement and queue creation remain explicit
steps documented in README.md. Proxmox examples are never auto-installed.

For the conventional filter without the persistent Linux USB transport,
omit --enable-persistent-usb. The conventional USB backend needs the CUPS
race fix described in README.md.
